		{"id":"55a4fb3d93db07a3","type":"text","text":"## One-Time Costs\n| Category | Cost |\n| ---- | ---- |\n| Capital Expenditures |  |\n| Incorporation Fees |  |","x":3400,"y":702,"width":520,"height":458,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"64534ec87408fbd1","type":"text","text":"# Cost Structure","x":2760,"y":120,"width":1160,"height":102,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7f9d160c55c43f12","type":"text","text":"# Revenue Streams\n\n**AI Strategic Integration and Roadmap:** This service offers a detailed analysis and formulation of strategies for AI integration into your business model. It not only maps the path forward but also identifies potential challenges and opportunities, ensuring a smooth transition into AI-enhanced operations.\n\n**Custom Training and Seminar Solutions:** Tailored specifically to your team's needs, these training programs and seminars are designed to boost AI literacy and application within your organization. They focus on practical, hands-on experiences to ensure your team can effectively utilize AI technologies in their daily operations.\n\n**Software Development and Solutioning:** Our custom software solutions are crafted to meet your unique business requirements, leveraging AI to drive efficiency and innovation. We focus on creating user-friendly, scalable solutions that integrate seamlessly with your existing systems and processes\n\n**Government & Contract Writing Services:** Specializing in navigating the complexities of government contracts, this service provides expert guidance and support in proposal writing, ensuring compliance and strategic alignment with government standards and expectations.\n\n## Projected Revenue\n\n| Type | Stream | Rev Goal |\n| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n| Education | YU | $80,000 |\n| Education | Uplimit | $200,000 |\n| Education | Kajabi | $300,000 |\n| Training | 1:1 Coaching |  |\n| Training | Professional Development |  |\n| Training | Integration |  |\n| Services | AI Integration Assessment and Scoping |  |\n| Services | KM and Generation |  |\n| Services | Automation Engineering |  |\n| Services | Chatbots and Prompt Engineering |  |\n| Services | Research |  |\n| Advertising | Goda's Youtube |  |\n| Advertising | Wes' Youtube |  |\n| Total |  |  |\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","x":2760,"y":1160,"width":1160,"height":960,"color":"2"},
